#api cal for create signup
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/fitwise/register/
Content-Type:  application/json

{
    "username":"yadhu",
    "email":"yadhu123@gmail.com",
    "password":"777"
}

#api cal for token
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/fitwise/token/ 
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"yadhu",
    "password":"777"
}

#api cal for get 
###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/fitwise/me/ 
