#api cal for list
###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/fitwise/foodlog/ 
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Token b4e26de113fda3c87fa0403ae3fe5bb0643f906d

#api call for create
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/fitwise/foodlog/ 
